    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "林雨晴 Ivy Lin，高雄人。第一份打工在巷口的麵包店，從那時起就喜歡看著客人帶著剛出爐的麵包離開。",
      "continues": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "從門市人員一路做到門市營運主任，排班、新人培訓、營收追蹤都是日常。遇到問題時，我會先到現場看一輪，再和同仁一起想辦法。",
      "continues": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "下班後常去其他品牌的店裡走走，觀察他們怎麼排陳列、怎麼招呼客人，回來再挑適合的做法試試看。",
      "continues": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "下一步想往多店營運的方向走，把現場經驗整理成能複製的做法，讓每家店都能穩穩運作。",
      "continues": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "Ivy Lin, from Kaohsiung. My first part-time job was at a small bakery around the corner, where I fell in love with fresh bread and happy regulars.",
      "continues": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "Starting on the shop floor, I grew into a store supervisor who plans rotas, coaches newcomers and watches daily takings closely.",
      "continues": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "On days off I wander through other shops, noting how they arrange shelves and greet guests, then try the best ideas back at our counter.",
      "continues": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "level": null,
      "label": null,
      "text": "Next, I want to look after several shops at once and turn what works on the floor into steps any branch can repeat.",
      "continues": false
